@startuml Artifact SequenceDiagram
actor Visitor
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "iBeacon" as Beacon
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Beacon -> App: Emit BLE signal
App -> API: Send beacon information

API -> DB: Resolve iBeacon and deployment location
DB --> API: Beacon and location data

API -> DB: Retrieve assigned Artifact
DB --> API: Artifact data

API --> App: Return artifact information
App --> Visitor: Display artifact information

App -> API: Send VisitorInteraction
API -> DB: Save VisitorInteraction
DB --> API: Interaction recorded
API --> App: Confirmation

@enduml

